        "Description": [
            {
                "value": "The VR training was developed using Unity and C#, and was optimized for execution on Windows, with compatibility for Oculus Quest 2 and Meta Quest 3. A detailed manual is provided for setup and installation, along with a guide for conducting the interviews to ensure ease of use and smooth implementation.",
